SUMMARY:Deadline: NOVA Games Foundation Fellows\, inaugural round (USD 100\
 ,000 to build an original game prototype)
DESCRIPTION:Founded by Mark Cerny and Geoff Keighley\, NOVA funds about 20 
 fellows a year to build a playable prototype of an original game\, with fe
 llows keeping full ownership and creative control.\n\nOrganisation: NOVA G
 ames Foundation\nLocation: Not specified. Open only to students and recent
  graduates of 59 programmes at 13 partner universities worldwide.\nAward: 
 USD 100\,000 non-repayable grant\, no equity taken\; press reports some fe
 llows can receive up to USD 500\,000 more after milestone reviews. No appl
 ication fee.\nDuration: About 6 to 12 months\n\nMore: https://novagamesfou
 ndation.org/how-to-apply?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
URL:https://novagamesfoundation.org/how-to-apply?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Not specified. Open only to students and recent graduates of 59 pr
 ogrammes at 13 partner universities worldwide.
END:VEVENT
