SUMMARY:Deadline: IDFA Bertha Fund: IBF Classic 2027 (documentary developme
 nt up to EUR 7\,500\, production up to EUR 25\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The IDFA Bertha Fund's IBF Classic scheme supports creative doc
 umentaries by filmmakers from countries on its Global South and Eastern Eu
 rope country list. Development grants of up to EUR 7\,500 pay for research
 \, writing\, shooting or a visual pitch\; production and post-production g
 rants of up to EUR 25\,000 pay for filming\, editing and finishing.\n\nOrg
 anisation: IDFA Bertha Fund (IDFA\, Amsterdam)\nLocation: Remote applicati
 on. Directors must be from and living in a country on the IBF Classic Coun
 try List (Africa\, Asia\, Eastern Europe\, Latin America\, Caribbean\, Oce
 ania).\nAward: Project Development up to EUR 7\,500\; Production and Post-
 production up to EUR 25\,000. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Fun
 ds cover costs incurred after final selection (about 3 months after the de
 adline)\n\nMore: https://professionals.idfa.nl/en/training-funding/funding
 /ibf-classic?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://professionals.idfa.nl/en/training-funding/funding/ibf-classic?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote application. Directors must be from and living in a country
  on the IBF Classic Country List (Africa\, Asia\, Eastern Europe\, Latin A
 merica\, Caribbean\, Oceania).
END:VEVENT
